# Machine-local agent tooling. `.claude/skills/apple-design` is a symlink to an
# absolute path inside this checkout, so committing it would bake a local
# filesystem path into the repository and break for everyone else. The real
# skill source is tracked at `.agents/skills/apple-design/`. Recreate the
# symlink locally if your tooling wants it.
.claude/

